{
  "fileVersion": "1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Workboard Class",
    "description": "Graph-local policy controller for task placement, ordering, and reconciliation.",
    "created": "2026-07-29T23:00:00.000Z",
    "modified": "2026-07-29T23:00:00.000Z",
    "tags": ["library", "node-class", "task-planning", "workboard"],
    "preferredViewer": "https://twilite.zone"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "workboard-class-manifest",
      "type": "manifest",
      "label": "Workboard Class",
      "position": { "x": -720, "y": -260 },
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "workboard-class",
          "name": "Workboard Class",
          "version": "0.1.0",
          "description": "Graph-local policy controller for task placement, ordering, and reconciliation."
        },
        "intent": { "kind": "node-class", "scope": "local" },
        "dependencies": {
          "nodeTypes": ["manifest", "view", "markdown"],
          "portContracts": ["core"],
          "skills": [],
          "schemaVersions": { "nodes": ">=1.0.0", "ports": ">=1.0.0" },
          "optional": []
        },
        "authority": {
          "mutation": {
            "allowCreate": true,
            "allowUpdate": true,
            "allowDelete": true,
            "appendOnly": false
          },
          "actors": { "humans": true, "agents": true, "tools": true },
          "styleAuthority": "descriptive"
        },
        "nodeClass": {
          "contractVersion": "1.0.0",
          "key": "workboard",
          "nodeDef": {
            "key": "workboard",
            "ref": "github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/workboard.node-class.node",
            "source": "local",
            "version": ">=0.1.0",
            "defaults": {
              "label": "Workboard",
              "size": { "width": 720, "height": 260 },
              "showLabel": false,
              "data": {
                "name": "Workboard",
                "description": "A focused operational view of source-owned task graphs.",
                "editorContributions": [
                  {
                    "id": "workboard-task-placement",
                    "match": {
                      "nodeType": "portal",
                      "pathExists": "data.board"
                    },
                    "section": {
                      "key": "placement",
                      "title": "Placement",
                      "summary": "Local workboard lane, ordering, and review state."
                    },
                    "fields": [
                      {
                        "key": "boardLaneMode",
                        "label": "Placement",
                        "type": "select",
                        "path": "data.board.laneMode",
                        "options": [
                          { "label": "Automatic from task status", "value": "auto" },
                          { "label": "Manual lane", "value": "manual" }
                        ],
                        "helperText": "Manual placement and pinning are synchronized for now. A pinned task keeps its selected lane; an unpinned task follows workboard policy."
                      },
                      {
                        "key": "boardLane",
                        "label": "Lane",
                        "type": "select",
                        "path": "data.board.lane",
                        "options": [
                          { "label": "Inbox", "value": "inbox" },
                          { "label": "Now", "value": "now" },
                          { "label": "Next", "value": "next" },
                          { "label": "Waiting", "value": "waiting" },
                          { "label": "Recently Completed", "value": "recently-completed" }
                        ],
                        "visibleWhen": { "path": "data.board.laneMode", "equals": "manual" }
                      },
                      {
                        "key": "boardPinned",
                        "label": "Pinned",
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "path": "data.board.pinned",
                        "helperText": "Pinned currently means manually placed: the task keeps its selected lane and is excluded from automatic placement."
                      },
                      {
                        "key": "boardRank",
                        "label": "Rank",
                        "type": "number",
                        "path": "data.board.rank",
                        "helperText": "Lower ranks appear first after pinning and priority rules."
                      },
                      {
                        "key": "boardReviewedAt",
                        "label": "Reviewed At",
                        "type": "text",
                        "path": "data.board.reviewedAt",
                        "placeholder": "YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss.sssZ"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "policy": {
                  "defaultLaneMode": "auto",
                  "unknownLane": "inbox",
                  "statusLanes": {
                    "todo": "next",
                    "in-progress": "now",
                    "blocked": "waiting",
                    "waiting": "waiting",
                    "done": "recently-completed",
                    "cancelled": "recently-completed"
                  },
                  "ordering": {
                    "pinnedFirst": true,
                    "priorityOrder": ["critical", "high", "medium", "low"],
                    "tieBreaker": "rank"
                  },
                  "automation": {
                    "freshReads": true,
                    "retainFailures": true
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workboard-editor-view",
      "type": "view",
      "label": "Editor View",
      "position": { "x": -280, "y": -260 },
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "view": { "intent": "editor", "payload": "editor.web" },
        "editor": {
          "web": {
            "layout": {
              "mode": "tabs",
              "sections": [
                { "key": "board", "title": "Board", "summary": "Identity and default placement behavior." },
                { "key": "lanes", "title": "Lanes", "summary": "Map task status to local workboard lanes." },
                { "key": "ordering", "title": "Ordering", "summary": "Control priority, pinning, and rank." },
                { "key": "automation", "title": "Automation", "summary": "Configure source reads and failure handling for the graph-owned reconciler." }
              ]
            },
            "fields": [
              { "key": "label", "label": "Node Label", "type": "text", "path": "label", "section": "board" },
              { "key": "name", "label": "Board Name", "type": "text", "path": "data.name", "section": "board" },
              { "key": "description", "label": "Description", "type": "markdown", "path": "data.description", "rows": 5, "section": "board" },
              {
                "key": "defaultLaneMode",
                "label": "Default Placement",
                "type": "select",
                "path": "data.policy.defaultLaneMode",
                "section": "board",
                "options": [
                  { "label": "Automatic from task status", "value": "auto" },
                  { "label": "Manual", "value": "manual" }
                ]
              },
              {
                "key": "unknownLane",
                "label": "Unknown Status Lane",
                "type": "select",
                "path": "data.policy.unknownLane",
                "section": "board",
                "options": [
                  { "label": "Inbox", "value": "inbox" },
                  { "label": "Now", "value": "now" },
                  { "label": "Next", "value": "next" },
                  { "label": "Waiting", "value": "waiting" }
                ]
              },
              { "key": "statusTodo", "label": "Todo", "type": "select", "path": "data.policy.statusLanes.todo", "section": "lanes", "options": [{ "label": "Inbox", "value": "inbox" }, { "label": "Now", "value": "now" }, { "label": "Next", "value": "next" }, { "label": "Waiting", "value": "waiting" }, { "label": "Recently Completed", "value": "recently-completed" }] },
              { "key": "statusActive", "label": "In Progress", "type": "select", "path": "data.policy.statusLanes.in-progress", "section": "lanes", "options": [{ "label": "Inbox", "value": "inbox" }, { "label": "Now", "value": "now" }, { "label": "Next", "value": "next" }, { "label": "Waiting", "value": "waiting" }, { "label": "Recently Completed", "value": "recently-completed" }] },
              { "key": "statusBlocked", "label": "Blocked", "type": "select", "path": "data.policy.statusLanes.blocked", "section": "lanes", "options": [{ "label": "Inbox", "value": "inbox" }, { "label": "Now", "value": "now" }, { "label": "Next", "value": "next" }, { "label": "Waiting", "value": "waiting" }, { "label": "Recently Completed", "value": "recently-completed" }] },
              { "key": "statusWaiting", "label": "Waiting", "type": "select", "path": "data.policy.statusLanes.waiting", "section": "lanes", "options": [{ "label": "Inbox", "value": "inbox" }, { "label": "Now", "value": "now" }, { "label": "Next", "value": "next" }, { "label": "Waiting", "value": "waiting" }, { "label": "Recently Completed", "value": "recently-completed" }] },
              { "key": "statusDone", "label": "Done", "type": "select", "path": "data.policy.statusLanes.done", "section": "lanes", "options": [{ "label": "Inbox", "value": "inbox" }, { "label": "Now", "value": "now" }, { "label": "Next", "value": "next" }, { "label": "Waiting", "value": "waiting" }, { "label": "Recently Completed", "value": "recently-completed" }] },
              { "key": "statusCancelled", "label": "Cancelled", "type": "select", "path": "data.policy.statusLanes.cancelled", "section": "lanes", "options": [{ "label": "Inbox", "value": "inbox" }, { "label": "Now", "value": "now" }, { "label": "Next", "value": "next" }, { "label": "Waiting", "value": "waiting" }, { "label": "Recently Completed", "value": "recently-completed" }] },
              { "key": "pinnedFirst", "label": "Pinned Tasks First", "type": "boolean", "path": "data.policy.ordering.pinnedFirst", "section": "ordering" },
              { "key": "priorityOrder", "label": "Priority Order", "type": "json", "path": "data.policy.ordering.priorityOrder", "section": "ordering", "rows": 5 },
              { "key": "tieBreaker", "label": "Tie Breaker", "type": "select", "path": "data.policy.ordering.tieBreaker", "section": "ordering", "options": [{ "label": "Rank", "value": "rank" }, { "label": "Title", "value": "title" }, { "label": "Updated time", "value": "updatedAt" }] },
              { "key": "freshReads", "label": "Read Fresh Source Graphs", "type": "boolean", "path": "data.policy.automation.freshReads", "section": "automation", "helperText": "When the graph-owned reconciler runs, bypass cached source graphs." },
              { "key": "retainFailures", "label": "Keep Failed Cards Visible", "type": "boolean", "path": "data.policy.automation.retainFailures", "section": "automation" }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workboard-detail-view",
      "type": "view",
      "label": "Detail View",
      "position": { "x": 200, "y": -260 },
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail",
          "controls": [
            { "id": "workboard-reconcile", "type": "button", "label": "Reconcile", "icon": "refresh", "variant": "contained", "priority": 10, "action": "emit", "event": "executeNode", "payload": { "nodeId": "workboard-reconciler", "meta": { "trigger": "workboard-control" } } },
            { "id": "workboard-edit", "type": "button", "label": "Edit", "icon": "edit", "variant": "outlined", "priority": "high", "action": "openEditor" }
          ]
        },
        "node": {
          "web": {
            "detail": {
              "html": "<div style='width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:22px 26px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111827,#1e3a5f 55%,#0f766e);color:#f8fafc;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.3);box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(2,6,23,.38);'><div style='width:74px;height:74px;border-radius:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px;padding:14px;box-sizing:border-box;background:rgba(15,23,42,.6);border:1px solid rgba(125,211,252,.38);flex:0 0 auto;'><span style='background:#7c3aed;border-radius:4px;'></span><span style='background:#ef4444;border-radius:4px;'></span><span style='background:#f59e0b;border-radius:4px;'></span><span style='background:#2563eb;border-radius:4px;'></span><span style='background:#22c55e;border-radius:4px;'></span><span style='background:#38bdf8;border-radius:4px;'></span></div><div style='min-width:0;flex:1;'><div style='font:700 10px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7dd3fc;margin-bottom:7px;'>Workboard Controller</div><div style='font:800 26px/1.05 Georgia,serif;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;'>{{data.name}}</div><div style='font:500 13px/1.45 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#cbd5e1;margin-top:8px;max-height:3em;overflow:hidden;'>{{data.description}}</div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:13px;'><span style='padding:5px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(56,189,248,.16);font:700 10px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#bae6fd;'>{{data.policy.defaultLaneMode}} placement</span><span style='padding:5px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(52,211,153,.14);font:700 10px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#a7f3d0;'>graph-owned policy</span></div></div></div>"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workboard-icon-view",
      "type": "view",
      "label": "Icon View",
      "position": { "x": 680, "y": -260 },
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "view": { "intent": "node", "payload": "node.web.icon" },
        "node": {
          "web": {
            "icon": {
              "html": "<div style='width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#111827,#164e63);color:#f8fafc;border:1px solid rgba(125,211,252,.3);'><div style='display:flex;gap:5px;'><span style='width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;background:#7c3aed;'></span><span style='width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;background:#ef4444;'></span><span style='width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;background:#f59e0b;'></span><span style='width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;background:#2563eb;'></span><span style='width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;background:#22c55e;'></span></div><div style='font:800 14px/1.2 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;text-align:center;'>{{data.name}}</div><div style='font:700 9px ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#7dd3fc;'>Workboard</div></div>"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workboard-notes",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Workboard Contract",
      "position": { "x": -280, "y": 100 },
      "width": 720,
      "height": 260,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Workboard policy\n\nThe controller owns graph-local projection policy. Source task graphs continue to own task status, priority, and the work itself. Portal carriers own local `data.board` placement overrides.\n\n- `laneMode: auto` follows the status-to-lane mapping.\n- `laneMode: manual` preserves the carrier's selected lane.\n- For now, pinning and manual placement are the same state: pinned carriers use `laneMode: manual`; unpinned carriers use `laneMode: auto`.\n- Rank remains local projection data, not source-task truth."
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": []
}
